### Valid leaderboard

GET http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard

### Invalid page

GET http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard?page=0

### Negative page

GET http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard?page=-3

### Invalid page size zero

GET http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard?pageSize=0

### Page size too large

GET http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard?pageSize=101

### Not enough players
GET http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard?page=100&pageSize=10

### Page is not a number
http://localhost:5204/api/leaderboard?page=hello